{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "LearnForge M7 deterministic evaluation benchmark. Expectations are behavioral (state/routing/grounding), derived from the supplied KB and the approved M3 assessment semantics. Citation PRESENCE is not asserted because the offline FakeProvider emits no citation markers; citation SAFETY (subset of allowed, no invalid keys, none on decline) is always checked.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "A1", "category": "answerable",
      "query": "How do I reset my password?",
